{
  "id": "llm_comparison",
  "title": "選擇大型語言模型的智慧：從基礎模型到 RAG",
  "resolution": "720x1280",
  "characters": {
    "A": {
      "name": "企鵝燈",
      "role": "questioner",
      "color": "#FFD54F"
    },
    "B": {
      "name": "熊大",
      "role": "explainer",
      "color": "#81C784"
    }
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "語言模型可不只會聊天，選錯會花大錢又沒效果。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "大型語言模型",
          "en": "Large Language Model (LLM)",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:1"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0001_B.mp3",
      "start": 0.1,
      "end": 4.876
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那我要怎麼挑？不是越貴越好嗎？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0002_A.mp3",
      "start": 4.996,
      "end": 8.38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "先搞清楚用途，要音訊、圖像還是文字。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0003_B.mp3",
      "start": 8.5,
      "end": 12.868
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "音訊用什麼？圖像又用什麼？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0004_A.mp3",
      "start": 12.988,
      "end": 16.228
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "音訊像 Whisper，圖像有 DALL-E，",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "多模態",
          "en": "Multimodal",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:1"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0005_B.mp3",
      "start": 16.348,
      "end": 19.924
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "文字看 GPT。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0006_B.mp3",
      "start": 20.044,
      "end": 22.06
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那多模態是啥？能吃嗎？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0007_A.mp3",
      "start": 22.18,
      "end": 25.156
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "多模態能處理文字、圖像、音訊，像全能選手。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0008_B.mp3",
      "start": 25.276,
      "end": 30.22
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "聽起來很猛，但會不會貴到爆？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0009_A.mp3",
      "start": 30.34,
      "end": 33.244
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "要比較任務質量、延遲、成本，不能只看價格。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0010_B.mp3",
      "start": 33.364,
      "end": 38.044
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "所以選模型像買手機，規格要看清楚。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0011_B.mp3",
      "start": 38.164,
      "end": 42.244
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "對，先搞清楚需求，再挑合適的，別盲從最新。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0012_A.mp3",
      "start": 42.364,
      "end": 46.948
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "為什麼有些模型免費下載，有些只能租用。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0013_B.mp3",
      "start": 47.068,
      "end": 50.98
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "好問題。先分清基礎模型和大型語言模型。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "基礎模型",
          "en": "Foundation Model",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:5"
        },
        {
          "cn": "大型語言模型",
          "en": "Large Language Model",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:3"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0014_B.mp3",
      "start": 51.1,
      "end": 55.876
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "基礎模型用無監督學習訓練，是其他模型的起點。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "無監督學習",
          "en": "Unsupervised Learning",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:5"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0015_A.mp3",
      "start": 55.996,
      "end": 60.628
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "像 GPT-3.5 是 ChatGPT 的基礎。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0016_B.mp3",
      "start": 60.748,
      "end": 64.948
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，微調後變成聊天版本，像樂高底座。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "微調",
          "en": "Fine-tuning",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:5"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0017_B.mp3",
      "start": 65.068,
      "end": 69.508
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "接著看開權重與專有模型的差別。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "開權重",
          "en": "Open-weights",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:6"
        },
        {
          "cn": "專有模型",
          "en": "Proprietary Model",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:6"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0018_A.mp3",
      "start": 69.628,
      "end": 73.084
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "開源能下載檢查，像自家廚房可隨意煮。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0019_B.mp3",
      "start": 73.204,
      "end": 77.092
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "專有只能租用，像高級餐廳不能進廚房。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0020_B.mp3",
      "start": 77.212,
      "end": 81.388
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那企業為何選專有？不能自己煮嗎？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0021_A.mp3",
      "start": 81.508,
      "end": 85.204
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "專有提供支援、安全與擴展，省去營運麻煩。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "擴展能力",
          "en": "Scalability",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:6"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0022_B.mp3",
      "start": 85.324,
      "end": 89.884
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "但無法檢查權重，需審查供應商條款。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "模型權重",
          "en": "Model Weights",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:6"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0023_B.mp3",
      "start": 90.004,
      "end": 93.964
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以免費不一定省，租用不一定虧。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0024_A.mp3",
      "start": 94.084,
      "end": 97.756
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "想像主管要你出考題，你有兩個同事。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0025_B.mp3",
      "start": 97.876,
      "end": 101.38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "一個只會寫，一個只會改。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0026_B.mp3",
      "start": 101.5,
      "end": 104.38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "對，寫的人像僅解碼器，看主題就續寫。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "僅解碼器",
          "en": "Decoder-only",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:8"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0027_A.mp3",
      "start": 104.5,
      "end": 108.676
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那改的人就是僅編碼器，只懂審不愛寫。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "僅編碼器",
          "en": "Encoder-only",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:9"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0028_B.mp3",
      "start": 108.796,
      "end": 112.948
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "沒錯，像 BERT 只做分類。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "編碼器-解碼器",
          "en": "Encoder-Decoder",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:10"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0029_B.mp3",
      "start": 113.068,
      "end": 115.756
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "兩者合體就是編碼器-解碼器。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0030_A.mp3",
      "start": 115.876,
      "end": 119.26
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那豈不是什麼都能做。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0031_B.mp3",
      "start": 119.38,
      "end": 121.372
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "對，像 BART 和 T5。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0032_B.mp3",
      "start": 121.492,
      "end": 123.988
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "接著看服務和模型的分別。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0033_A.mp3",
      "start": 124.108,
      "end": 126.748
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "服務比較貴？服務含模型和資料，付費換便利；",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "服務",
          "en": "Service",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:11"
        },
        {
          "cn": "模型",
          "en": "Model",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:12"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0034_A.mp3",
      "start": 126.868,
      "end": 131.932
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "模型可自託管但要硬體。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0035_B.mp3",
      "start": 132.052,
      "end": 134.812
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "模型笨笨的，除了罵它還能怎麼辦？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0036_A.mp3",
      "start": 134.932,
      "end": 138.484
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "有三招：提示工程、RAG，還有微調。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "提示工程",
          "en": "Prompt Engineering",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:3"
        },
        {
          "cn": "RAG",
          "en": "Retrieval-Augmented Generation",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:3"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0037_B.mp3",
      "start": 138.604,
      "end": 142.78
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "提示工程。那不就是多講幾句話。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0038_B.mp3",
      "start": 142.9,
      "end": 146.404
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "對，但要有料。給例子和上下文，模型就懂。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0039_A.mp3",
      "start": 146.524,
      "end": 151.036
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "所以像教小孩，要講清楚才不會搞砸。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0040_B.mp3",
      "start": 151.156,
      "end": 155.14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "正是！這是最省錢的入門招。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0041_B.mp3",
      "start": 155.26,
      "end": 158.668
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "那要是模型不知道新消息呢？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0042_A.mp3",
      "start": 158.788,
      "end": 161.38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "就用 RAG，把最新資料餵給它。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "檢索增強生成",
          "en": "Retrieval-Augmented Generation",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:4"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0043_B.mp3",
      "start": 161.5,
      "end": 164.476
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "哦，像考試偷看小抄。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0044_B.mp3",
      "start": 164.596,
      "end": 167.284
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "差不多，但抄得聰明。需要私人數據就靠它。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0045_A.mp3",
      "start": 167.404,
      "end": 171.748
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "那微調呢。聽起來更厲害。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0046_B.mp3",
      "start": 171.868,
      "end": 175.06
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "微調是讓模型練成特定風格，像特訓。",
      "terms": [
        {
          "cn": "微調",
          "en": "Fine-tuning",
          "source": "materials/genai-beginners/zh-HK/02-exploring-and-comparing-different-llms/README.md:5"
        }
      ],
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0047_B.mp3",
      "start": 175.18,
      "end": 179.212
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "所以先試便宜的，不夠再升級？",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0048_A.mp3",
      "start": 179.332,
      "end": 182.596
    },
    {
      "speaker": "B",
      "text": "聰明！先提示工程，再 RAG，最後微調。",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0049_B.mp3",
      "start": 182.716,
      "end": 187.42
    },
    {
      "speaker": "A",
      "text": "懂了！以後模型再笨，我有三招治它，咕咕嘎嘎！",
      "_sfx": "咕咕嘎嘎",
      "audio_file": "audio/lines/tts_llm_comparison_line0050_A.mp3",
      "start": 187.54,
      "end": 191.5
    }
  ]
}